  "aboutPlatformTitle": "Designed for MicroPython + BLE",
  "@aboutPlatformTitle": {
    "description": "About section heading for board-neutral compatibility."
  },
  "aboutPlatformBody": "PyBLE is designed for boards that can run MicroPython and host a compatible PBLE/1 agent. ESP32, ESP32-S3, and ESP32-C3 are the initial firmware targets; support expands through validated open ports. Board-specific pin defaults and hardware profiles are never assumed.",
